      "id": "claim_c1794201ece6413999ecabd9101c426a",
      "statement": "The SPA is a single evaluated HtmlTemplate (html/Index.html) that include()-pulls CSS, Modals, Modals_Withdraw, JS_Utils, JS_Signature, JS, JS_Beneficiary, JS_Withdraw, and JS_Feedback into one document; doGet() must use createTemplateFromFile + evaluate() (not createHtmlOutputFromFile) so the <?!= ?> includes work, and include() itself returns HtmlService.createHtmlOutputFromFile(filename).getContent().",
