      "statement": "window.PFSignature is a handle-based wrapper over signature_pad (CDN) exposing mount(canvas, onEnd?) returning {pad,canvas,onEnd,resize}, isEmpty(handle), getDataUrl(handle), clear(handle), destroy(handle); each flow owns its own pad instance via a handle so the enrollment wizard (step 5) and beneficiary sign view do not collide.",
