      "id": "claim_1ba74883e73f4a69b5e200df9eae8884",
      "statement": "PFSignature.getDataUrl() auto-trims the export to the ink's bounding box (8px pad in device pixels) by scanning the alpha channel, so a small/corner signature exports tight; it falls back to the full-canvas pad.toDataURL on no-ink/failure, and the letter generator then scales the tight crop to fit its box. Callers gate submit on isEmpty(handle), not on a non-null data URL.",
      "evidence": [
